# ── IFM version control ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Purpose: track the CODE (games, scripts, docs) so any bad edit can be rolled
# back with one command. Heavy media is deliberately excluded — it doesn't change
# during a build, it already exists on disk and on Vercel, and including it would
# bloat the repo by ~1.9 GB.

# Video / audio
*.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.webm
*.mkv
*.mp3
*.wav
*.m4a

# Documents (the handbook PDF alone is 742 MB)
*.pdf
*.ppsx
*.pptx
*.xlsx

# Images
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.gif
*.ico
*.heic

# Archives
*.zip
*.tar
*.gz

# Tooling / OS
node_modules/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
.vercel
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.gstack/
**/.gstack/
